WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
What about the heavy rain forecast? Where did it come from?

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:04,040
Water and electricity have been gradually restored today

3
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:05,600
I heard that water comes to our community at ten o'clock

4
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,680
The call before 4pm scared me last night

5
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:08,920
I really thought it was the end of the world

6
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,280
I just said there’s no need to swallow anything.

7
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:11,720
My mother has to buy a lot of vegetables.

8
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:12,720
The power is out at home

9
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:14,280
The refrigerator doesn't work. It's completely rotten.

10
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:18,000
No

11
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,520
The old man doesn't listen to advice

12
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:21,000
My old man is the same, too.

13
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,520
The school announced that classes will resume in the afternoon

14
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,160
The one in my house is miserable

15
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:27,800
And asked me why the end of the world hasn’t come yet

16
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:34,010
this world

17
00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:36,110
Why does it look like it's changed?

18
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:37,910
If Tuntun hadn't still been there

19
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:39,270
I even thought

20
00:00:39,270 --> 00:00:41,640
I just had a dream yesterday

21
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,440
I heard that supermarkets have resumed supply.

22
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:51,220
Drop by and take a look

23
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:52,900
Don't swallow it

24
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:54,620
It's not like making a movie

25
00:00:54,620 --> 00:01:00,460
Where did the end of the world come from?

26
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:02,620
What was called loss yesterday

27
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:05,540
Now classified as a living dead virus

28
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:06,700
News and marketing accounts

29
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:10,180
Passed it over and over again

30
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:12,900
Hearing does not travel through the air

31
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:13,900
people panic

32
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:18,820
It seemed like 80% of it was gone at once

33
00:01:18,820 --> 00:01:19,860
The company's income is average

34
00:01:19,860 --> 00:01:21,060
Decided to stop filming

35
00:01:21,060 --> 00:01:22,950
All new projects are suspended

36
00:01:22,950 --> 00:01:24,870
lay off employees

37
00:01:24,870 --> 00:01:25,950
Please come back to the company today

38
00:01:25,950 --> 00:01:26,950
Pack personal belongings
